# BWS Secrets Required for CI/CD

All secrets are stored in [Bitwarden Secrets Manager](https://bitwarden.com/products/secrets-manager/) and fetched at runtime via `bws secret list`. The only GitHub secrets required are `BWS_ACCESS_TOKEN` (authenticates with BWS) and `CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN` (authenticates Claude Code for auto-fix).

## Naming Convention

Project-specific keys use a dynamic prefix derived from the repository name:

```
<%= app_name %> -> strip "_core" -> <%= app_name.sub(/_core$/, '') %> -> <%= bws_prefix %>
```

For example, `<%= bws_prefix %>_RAILS_MASTER_KEY`.

Keys without a prefix are shared across projects.

## CI Secrets (`ci.yml`)

Used by the `test` and `system-test` jobs (`{PREFIX}` = `<%= bws_prefix %>`):

| BWS Key | Used As | Description |
|---------|---------|-------------|
| `<%= bws_prefix %>_RAILS_MASTER_KEY` | `RAILS_MASTER_KEY` | Rails master key for credentials decryption |
| `<%= bws_prefix %>_ACTIVE_RECORD_ENCRYPTION_PRIMARY_KEY` | `ACTIVE_RECORD_ENCRYPTION_PRIMARY_KEY` | Active Record encryption primary key |
| `<%= bws_prefix %>_ACTIVE_RECORD_ENCRYPTION_DETERMINISTIC_KEY` | `ACTIVE_RECORD_ENCRYPTION_DETERMINISTIC_KEY` | Active Record deterministic encryption key |
| `<%= bws_prefix %>_ACTIVE_RECORD_ENCRYPTION_KEY_DERIVATION_SALT` | `ACTIVE_RECORD_ENCRYPTION_KEY_DERIVATION_SALT` | Active Record encryption key derivation salt |

Used by the `notify_checks_failed` job:

| BWS Key | Used As | Description |
|---------|---------|-------------|
| `BREVO_SMTP_USERNAME` | SMTP username | Brevo SMTP login for sending email notifications |
| `DEPLOY_NOTIFICATION_EMAIL` | Recipient address | Email address that receives CI/CD notifications |
| `<%= bws_prefix %>_BREVO_SMTP_KEY` | SMTP password | Brevo SMTP authentication key |

## CD Secrets (`cd.yml`)

Used by the `deploy` job:

| BWS Key | Used As | Description |
|---------|---------|-------------|
| `DOCKER_REGISTRY_USER` | Docker Hub username | Used for Docker Hub login and image tagging |
| `KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD` | Docker Hub password | Docker Hub authentication for push/pull |
| `BREVO_SMTP_USERNAME` | SMTP username | Brevo SMTP login for sending email notifications |
| `DEPLOY_NOTIFICATION_EMAIL` | Recipient address | Email address that receives CI/CD notifications |
| `<%= bws_prefix %>_BREVO_SMTP_KEY` | SMTP password | Brevo SMTP authentication key |
| `SSH_PRIVATE_KEY_HETZNER` | SSH private key | SSH key for connecting to deployment servers |

## Kamal Command Secrets (`kamal.yml`)

Used by the `command` job:

| BWS Key | Used As | Description |
|---------|---------|-------------|
| `SSH_PRIVATE_KEY_HETZNER` | SSH private key | SSH key for connecting to deployment servers |
| `KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD` | Docker registry password | Passed to Kamal for registry authentication |

## All Unique BWS Keys

Shared (no prefix):

| # | BWS Key |
|---|---------|
| 1 | `BREVO_SMTP_USERNAME` |
| 2 | `DEPLOY_NOTIFICATION_EMAIL` |
| 3 | `DOCKER_REGISTRY_USER` |
| 4 | `KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD` |
| 5 | `SSH_PRIVATE_KEY_HETZNER` |

Project-specific (prefixed, shown for `<%= bws_prefix %>`):

| # | BWS Key |
|---|---------|
| 6 | `<%= bws_prefix %>_ACTIVE_RECORD_ENCRYPTION_DETERMINISTIC_KEY` |
| 7 | `<%= bws_prefix %>_ACTIVE_RECORD_ENCRYPTION_KEY_DERIVATION_SALT` |
| 8 | `<%= bws_prefix %>_ACTIVE_RECORD_ENCRYPTION_PRIMARY_KEY` |
| 9 | `<%= bws_prefix %>_BREVO_SMTP_KEY` |
| 10 | `<%= bws_prefix %>_RAILS_MASTER_KEY` |
